Trust Score Formula
text
Trust Score = (Freshness × w1) + (Authority × w2) + (Verification × w3)

Where: w1 + w2 + w3 = 1.0 (configurable)
Components
Freshness
Based on last update date:

Days Since Update	Score
≤ 30 days	1.0
≤ 90 days	0.8
≤ 180 days	0.5
≤ 365 days	0.2
> 365 days	0.0
Authority
Based on creator's role:

Role	Score
Department Head	1.0
Team Lead	0.8
Senior Employee	0.6
Regular Employee	0.4
External Source	0.2
Verification
Based on validation status:

Status	Score
Manually Verified by Trusted User	1.0
Auto-Verified by System	0.7
Unverified	0.0
Configuration
sql
CREATE TABLE trust_config (
    id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    freshness_weight FLOAT DEFAULT 0.4,
    authority_weight FLOAT DEFAULT 0.3,
    verification_weight FLOAT DEFAULT 0.3,
    freshness_decay_days JSON DEFAULT '{
        "high": 30,
        "medium": 90,
        "low": 180
    }',
    authority_roles JSON DEFAULT '{
        "head": 1.0,
        "lead": 0.8,
        "senior": 0.6,
        "regular": 0.4,
        "external": 0.2
    }',
    updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
);
