14_decay_engine.md
Decay Rules (MVP)
Rule	Trigger	Detection Method
Age	No update for 180 days	Check last_updated
Author Left	Creator is no longer active	Check employee status
Age-Based Decay
text
days_old = (now - last_updated).days

if days_old > 180:
    decay_score = min(1.0, (days_old - 180) / 365)
else:
    decay_score = 0.0
Author Left Decay
text
if creator.is_active == false:
    decay_score = 0.7
else:
    decay_score = 0.0
Overall Decay Score
text
decay_score = max(age_decay, author_left_decay)
